="author"><name><surname>Lifeso</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Young</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The neglected hip fracture</article-title><source>J Orthop Trauma</source><year>1990</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>287</fpage><lpage>292</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00005131-199004030-00009</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Lifeso R, Young D (1990) The neglected hip fracture. J Orthop Trauma 4:287&#x02013;292 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2231127</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR7"><label>7.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nagi</surname><given-names>ON</given-names></name><name><surname>Dhillon</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Gill</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Fibular osteosynthesis for delayed type II and type III femoral neck fractures in children</article-title><source>J Orthop Trauma</source><year>1992</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>306</fpage><lpage>313</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Nagi ON, Dhillon MS, Gill SS (1992) Fibular osteosynthesis for delayed type II and type III femoral neck fractures in children. J Orthop Trauma 6:306&#x02013;313 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1403249</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR8"><label>8.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Banks</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Nonunion in fractures of the femoral neck</article-title><source>Orthop Clin North Am</source><year>1974</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>865</fpage><lpage>885</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Banks HH (1974) Nonunion in fractures of the femoral neck. Orthop Clin North Am 5:865&#x02013;885 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4606848</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR9"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jackson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Learmonth</surname><given-names>ID</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The treatment of non union after intracapsular fracture of the proximal femur</article-title><source>Clin Orthop</source><year>2002</year><volume>399</volume><fpage>119</fpage><lpage>128</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00003086-200206000-00014</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Jackson M, Learmonth ID (2002) The treatment of non union after intracapsular fracture of the proximal femur. Clin Orthop 399:119&#x02013;128 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12011700</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>LeCroy</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Rizzo</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Gunneson</surname><given-names>EE</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Free vascularised fibular bone grafting in the management of femoral neck non union in patients younger than fifty years</article-title><source>J Orthop Trauma</source><year>2002</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>464</fpage><lpage>472</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00005131-200208000-00004</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">LeCroy CM, Rizzo M, Gunneson EE et al (2002) Free vascularised fibular bone grafting in the management of femoral neck non union in patients younger than fifty years. J Orthop Trauma 16:464&#x02013;472 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12172276</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pauwels</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><source>Biomechanics of the normal and diseased hi